<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Imation upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Imation upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it raised the rating on Imation Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 7/8 to 28-1/2.</p>
</text>
